sequenceDiagram
    participant Sheet as Google Sheet
    participant N8N as n8n
    participant API as Local RPA API
    participant Device as Browser/Android Device
    participant Platform as Social Platform
    participant Operator as Human Operator

    N8N->>Sheet: Read first ready row
    Sheet-->>N8N: Return content and media links
    N8N->>N8N: Normalize fields and create lane items
    alt Direct API platform
        N8N->>Platform: Publish through approved API
        Platform-->>N8N: Return status or error
    else RPA platform
        N8N->>API: Submit publish job
        API->>Device: Start attended automation
        Device->>Platform: Fill post fields and upload media
        Platform-->>Device: Draft, warning, or confirmation state
        Device-->>Operator: Stop when human action is required
        API-->>N8N: Return structured job status
    end
    N8N->>Sheet: Update exact row with platform results

